Date: 2026-04-18
Branch: refactor/prediction-v2
Gate: V2 (host-only 30s playtest). Pass = 0 [D-LOC], 0 [D-LOC FATAL], active-tick heartbeat divergences=0.

## Run 1 — FAILED

[D-LOC] warning count: 99
Patterns observed:
  - fwd=7.5→5.0→2.5 delta on T=3245-3247 (3 consecutive ticks) — launch-handoff blend throttle scaling not mirrored by shadow
  - clamp-gate mismatch realClamp=True shadowClamp=False on T=3299+ (many ticks) — BuildTickContext read post-clamp rb.velocity

