  2026-04-18T16:12:14.908 | Warning | [D-LOC] T=4110 clamp-gate mismatch: realClamp=True shadowClamp=False

Root cause diagnosis:
  Bug 1: motor.ApplyLaunchHandoffInputScaling (motor.cs:1537) modifies resolvedThrottle during Blend/Inherit launch states; shadow used raw input.Throttle.
  Bug 2: BuildTickContext reads rb.velocity AFTER motor.ClampPlanarSpeed wrote via _predictionRigidbody.Velocity(); shadow saw post-clamp velocity and could not detect the clamp condition.

Fix applied (between Run 1 and Run 2):
  - BuddahPredictionTickContext redesigned from 14 fields to 9 — carries ForwardDirection, ResolvedThrottle, ResolvedSteering (motor's post-scaling values) and RbVelocityPreTick (snapshot).
  - BuddahLocomotionStep stripped of redundant gates (only called from motor's active path).
  - Motor: added _shadowPreClampVelocity snapshot on the line immediately before ClampPlanarSpeed; BuildTickContext now receives forwardDirection/resolvedThrottle/resolvedSteering as parameters from the call site.

